{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>渴望學習繪畫卻不知從何下手嗎？《AR Trace &amp; Draw》現正限時免費，它能將你的智能手機瞬間化身為強大的繪圖投影機，讓無論是繪畫新手想學習基礎、或是資深藝術家尋求加速草稿過程，都能輕鬆上手，在短短幾分鐘內將任何圖片描繪到紙上，創造出令人驚嘆的藝術作品。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/460x460bb-75-45.webp\" alt=\"限時免費\">\n    <h2>AR 實時追蹤與精準筆觸調整</h2>\n    <p>這款《AR Trace &amp; Draw》應用利用 AR 追蹤技術，能將虛擬圖像直接投影至紙面，助您精準描繪。其獨特的線條粗細與透明度控制，讓筆觸調整更自由。內建的智能圖像庫，涵蓋動物、動漫等多元主題，為各級繪畫愛好者提供豐富靈感。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-83-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-84-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-85-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-86-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-87-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-17-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>應用名稱：AR Trace &amp; Draw</li>\n      <li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n      <li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n    </ul>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-10T19:37:25.935587+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}